+// --- overlay patch 0015: sky diagnostics (R2.3 fix 5) -----------------------
+// What the sky pass actually saw and actually drew, per eye, for `q3evrskynow`.
+// The device symptom — sky only inside a square that follows the view centre,
+// with a stair-stepped border — is exactly the shape a SHORT accumulation
+// produces, because DrawSkyBox quantizes the accumulated s/t bounds to the
+// subdivision grid. Nothing here changes behaviour; it records the numbers that
+// tell a device session which half of the pipeline is at fault, and it is read
+// through one string builder so the shell never needs this file's statics.
